{"id":"80dcb26cf7d15754","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md","title":"Cardinal Arithmetic","display":"df-cardinal-arithmetic — Cardinal Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cardinal-arithmetic","aliases":["58-df-cardinal-arithmetic","Cardinal Arithmetic"],"display":"df-cardinal-arithmetic — Cardinal Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cardinal-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cardinal-arithmetic</span><span>Cardinal Arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinal-arithmetic — Cardinal Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md\">../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardAdd}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardAdd}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)\\)</span> (cardinal-addition relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardMul}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardMul}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)\\)</span> (cardinal-multiplication relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)\\)</span> (cardinal-exponentiation relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}addition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardAdd}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\lambda\\times\\{1\\})|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}addition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardAdd}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\lambda\\times\\{1\\})|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardMul}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|\\kappa\\times\\lambda|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardMul}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|\\kappa\\times\\lambda|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardExp}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|{}^\\lambda\\kappa|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardExp}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|{}^\\lambda\\kappa|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cardinal addition uses a tagged disjoint union, multiplication uses a Cartesian product, and exponentiation uses the function set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{}^\\lambda\\kappa\">\\({}^\\lambda\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>These operations depend only on cardinalities, unlike ordinal addition and ordinal multiplication.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0 + \\aleph_0 = \\aleph_0, \\aleph_0 \\cdot \\aleph_0 = \\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0 + \\aleph_0 = \\aleph_0, \\aleph_0 \\cdot \\aleph_0 = \\aleph_0\\)</span> (countable arithmetic)</li>\n<li>Hausdorff: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^{\\aleph_0} = \\kappa^\\alpha\">\\(\\kappa^{\\aleph_0} = \\kappa^\\alpha\\)</span> for successor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa = \\alpha^+\">\\(\\kappa = \\alpha^+\\)</span> under GCH</li>\n<li>GCH: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\kappa = \\kappa^+\">\\(2^\\kappa = \\kappa^+\\)</span> for all infinite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; simplifies arithmetic greatly</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-cartesian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardAdd}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardMul}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardExp}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}addition} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardAdd}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|(\\kappa\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\lambda\\times\\{1\\})|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}multiplication} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardMul}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|\\kappa\\times\\lambda|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\mathrm{CardExp}(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\mu=|{}^\\lambda\\kappa|","display":true},{"tex":"{}^\\lambda\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0 + \\aleph_0 = \\aleph_0, \\aleph_0 \\cdot \\aleph_0 = \\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^{\\aleph_0} = \\kappa^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa = \\alpha^+","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\kappa = \\kappa^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2195,"backlinks":[{"id":"7c86c0c2d460d62a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-cardinal-arithmetic.md|58-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","445e1cd0bb5274eb","36d7463d215be751"]}